592186562867} {:answer/id #uuid "5e879290-41ce-5caa-9a80-54fb5adc6df8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562875}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5e879290-41ce-5caa-9a80-54fb5adc6df8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562875} :answer-field/id #uuid "cbcce078-a3f1-5646-afef-3c0d9a54a619" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562906}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "514aa297-d018-5213-8e1d-3b49622a8fe3" :question/problem "<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$O=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -3 & -5 & -5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$P=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ -8 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$R=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 6 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 7 & 6 \\\\ 4 & -7 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $O,P,$ and $R?$\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The product $OP$ is well defined\n\n- **II.** The product $PR$ is well defined\n\n- **III.** The product $PO$ is well defined" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $O$ is a $1\\times 4$ row vector, $P$ is a $5\\times 1$ column vector, and $R$ is a $5\\times 3$ matrix.\n\nThere are $4$ columns in $O$ and $5$ rows in $P.$ Since the number of columns in $O$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $P,$ the matrices $O$ and $P$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{O}_{1\\times 4}{\\times }_{\\ne }{P}_{5\\times 1}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there is $1$ column in $P$ and $5$ rows in $R.$ Since the number of columns in $P$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $R,$ the matrices $P$ and $R$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{P}_{5\\times 1}{\\times }_{\\ne }{R}_{5\\times 3}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there is $1$ column in $P$ and $1$ row in $O.$ Since the number of columns in $P$ equals the number of rows in $O,$ the matrices $P$ and $O$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{P}_{5\\times \\boxed{\\text{1}}}{\\times }_{✓}{O}_{\\boxed{\\text{1}}\\times 4}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nTherefore, statement III is true, while statements I and II are false."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186562872 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100869 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b494140f-206a-5317-8079-ff719a253140" :knowledge-point/title "Determining Whether Two Matrices Are Conformable for Multiplication" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048783 :topic/title "Conformability for Matrix Multiplication"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7f4356be-29f1-5e2b-830b-308a53df5c34" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562882} {:answer/id #uuid "85c9a81f-67cf-5cc7-90ed-a7b1dbdd973d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562885}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7f4356be-29f1-5e2b-830b-308a53df5c34" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562882} :answer-field/id #uuid "63b06bda-1c4c-596d-b2b7-2455e8bb3e84" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562878} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4c2fb6f9-03f7-5731-ba5a-e3e4edd662b9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562868} {:answer/id #uuid "4d370fc6-4fed-5c27-900c-ba8012cedd47" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562869}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4d370fc6-4fed-5c27-900c-ba8012cedd47" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562869} :answer-field/id #uuid "b42c3153-374b-54ee-86c7-d7414ae8c1d5" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562899} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "934a6aee-e168-56ff-aaa0-3c4a7d248df1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562890} {:answer/id #uuid "db1d43c6-c9b4-5900-96b1-0aa4ef8e6ae3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562912}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "934a6aee-e168-56ff-aaa0-3c4a7d248df1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562890} :answer-field/id #uuid "fb318e8d-7c03-55c8-bc35-aa74f911f214" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562920}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "55f9a3f4-1446-576a-9dd6-8f5cec99c326" :question/problem "<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$O=\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$P=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$R=\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & -4 \\\\ -1 & -7 \\\\ -2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -4 \\\\ 4 & 8\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $O,P,$ and $R?$\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The product $OR$ is well defined\n\n- **II.** The product $PO$ is well defined\n\n- **III.** The product $OP$ is well defined" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $O$ is a $3\\times 1$ column vector, $P$ is a $1\\times 2$ row vector, and $R$ is a $5\\times 2$ matrix.\n\nThere is $1$ column in $O$ and $5$ rows in $R.$ Since the number of columns in $O$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $R,$ the matrices $O$ and $R$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{O}_{3\\times 1}{\\times }_{\\ne }{R}_{5\\times 2}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $2$ columns in $P$ and $3$ rows in $O.$ Since the number of columns in $P$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $O,$ the matrices $P$ and $O$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{P}_{1\\times 2}{\\times }_{\\ne }{O}_{3\\times 1}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there is $1$ column in $O$ and $1$ row in $P.$ Since the number of columns in $O$ equals the number of rows in $P,$ the matrices $O$ and $P$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{O}_{3\\times \\boxed{\\text{1}}}{\\times }_{✓}{P}_{\\boxed{\\text{1}}\\times 2}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nTherefore, statement III is true, while statements I and II are false."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186562881 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100869 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b494140f-206a-5317-8079-ff719a253140" :knowledge-point/title "Determining Whether Two Matrices Are Conformable for Multiplication" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048783 :topic/title "Conformability for Matrix Multiplication"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "34dafa4d-3944-582e-bbf7-64a2dcc62647" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562862} {:answer/id #uuid "d55b794e-24e2-5354-bfec-ef76085b2a8c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562909}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d55b794e-24e2-5354-bfec-ef76085b2a8c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562909} :answer-field/id #uuid "3045f8ab-525f-5485-b581-68eae6f98ef3" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562860} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "34e4c5ce-7e9c-5530-8b6b-ec090d2ebab0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562863} {:answer/id #uuid "a87f780f-4b8f-5015-b434-03be4bcc01d7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562896}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "34e4c5ce-7e9c-5530-8b6b-ec090d2ebab0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562863} :answer-field/id #uuid "45d02062-6090-52e6-a662-c6361863dc12" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562865} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2a4cd583-5b45-56dc-a6e1-195b989eb2a3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562858} {:answer/id #uuid "63547524-da22-5745-afb6-a330347919c4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562877}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2a4cd583-5b45-56dc-a6e1-195b989eb2a3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562858} :answer-field/id #uuid "8307eb05-c0ad-51ff-8381-69c2aa369a62" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562884}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "795f6284-9977-53c9-b26a-515ee6438422" :question/problem "<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$O=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -6 & -9 & -1 & 4 \\\\ -9 & 4 & 2 & 8 & 4 \\\\ 6 & 8 & 4 & -4 & -8 \\\\ -1 & 9 & -3 & -7 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$P=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & -5 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$R=\\begin{bmatrix}-9 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $O,P,$ and $R?$\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The product $RO$ is well defined\n\n- **II.** The product $PR$ is well defined\n\n- **III.** The product $RP$ is well defined" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $O$ is a $4\\times 5$ matrix, $P$ is a $1\\times 4$ row vector, and $R$ is a $2\\times 1$ column vector.\n\nThere is $1$ column in $R$ and $4$ rows in $O.$ Since the number of columns in $R$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $O,$ the matrices $R$ and $O$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{R}_{2\\times 1}{\\times }_{\\ne }{O}_{4\\times 5}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $4$ columns in $P$ and $2$ rows in $R.$ Since the number of columns in $P$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $R,$ the matrices $P$ and $R$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{P}_{1\\times 4}{\\times }_{\\ne }{R}_{2\\times 1}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there is $1$ column in $R$ and $1$ row in $P.$ Since the number of columns in $R$ equals the number of rows in $P,$ the matrices $R$ and $P$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{R}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{1}}}{\\times }_{✓}{P}_{\\boxed{\\text{1}}\\times 4}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nTherefore, statement III is true, while statements I and II are false."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186562887 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100869 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b494140f-206a-5317-8079-ff719a253140" :knowledge-point/title "Determining Whether Two Matrices Are Conformable for Multiplication" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048783 :topic/t